  "notes": "12-step lime scale with a matching dark-mode scale. Steps 1-2: app and subtle backgrounds. 3-5: component backgrounds (normal, hover, pressed). 6-8: borders and focus rings. 9-10: solid backgrounds (e.g. buttons). 11-12: low and high contrast text.\n\nAlso available: limeA (alpha) and P3 wide-gamut versions.\n\nUse: npm i @radix-ui/colors, then import \"@radix-ui/colors/lime.css\" and \"@radix-ui/colors/lime-dark.css\".\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/radix-ui/colors/blob/main/src/light.ts",
  "code": "<style>\n:root {\n  --lime-1: #fcfdfa;\n  --lime-2: #f8faf3;\n  --lime-3: #eef6d6;\n  --lime-4: #e2f0bd;\n  --lime-5: #d3e7a6;\n  --lime-6: #c2da91;\n  --lime-7: #abc978;\n  --lime-8: #8db654;\n  --lime-9: #bdee63;\n  --lime-10: #b0e64c;\n  --lime-11: #5c7c2f;\n  --lime-12: #37401c;\n}\n.dark {\n  --lime-1: #11130c;\n  --lime-2: #151a10;\n  --lime-3: #1f2917;\n  --lime-4: #29371d;\n  --lime-5: #334423;\n  --lime-6: #3d522a;\n  --lime-7: #496231;\n  --lime-8: #577538;\n  --lime-9: #bdee63;\n  --lime-10: #d4ff70;\n  --lime-11: #bde56c;\n  --lime-12: #e3f7ba;\n}\n.scale { font: 12px system-ui, sans-serif; width: min(720px, 100%); }\n.scale p { margin: 12px 0 4px; color: #555; }\n.scale .row { display: grid; grid-auto-flow: column; grid-auto-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }\n.scale .row div { height: 48px; border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: end; padding: 4px; }\n.scale span { font-size: 10px; background: #fff9; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0 3px; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"scale\"><strong>Radix lime</strong>\n<p>light</p><div class=\"row\"><div style=\"background:#fcfdfa\" title=\"--lime-1: #fcfdfa\"><span>1</span></div><div style=\"background:#f8faf3\" title=\"--lime-2: #f8faf3\"><span>2</span></div><div style=\"background:#eef6d6\" title=\"--lime-3: #eef6d6\"><span>3</span></div><div style=\"background:#e2f0bd\" title=\"--lime-4: #e2f0bd\"><span>4</span></div><div style=\"background:#d3e7a6\" title=\"--lime-5: #d3e7a6\"><span>5</span></div><div style=\"background:#c2da91\" title=\"--lime-6: #c2da91\"><span>6</span></div><div style=\"background:#abc978\" title=\"--lime-7: #abc978\"><span>7</span></div><div style=\"background:#8db654\" title=\"--lime-8: #8db654\"><span>8</span></div><div style=\"background:#bdee63\" title=\"--lime-9: #bdee63\"><span>9</span></div><div style=\"background:#b0e64c\" title=\"--lime-10: #b0e64c\"><span>10</span></div><div style=\"background:#5c7c2f\" title=\"--lime-11: #5c7c2f\"><span>11</span></div><div style=\"background:#37401c\" title=\"--lime-12: #37401c\"><span>12</span></div></div>\n<p>dark</p><div class=\"row\"><div style=\"background:#11130c\" title=\"--lime-1: #11130c\"><span>1</span></div><div style=\"background:#151a10\" title=\"--lime-2: #151a10\"><span>2</span></div><div style=\"background:#1f2917\" title=\"--lime-3: #1f2917\"><span>3</span></div><div style=\"background:#29371d\" title=\"--lime-4: #29371d\"><span>4</span></div><div style=\"background:#334423\" title=\"--lime-5: #334423\"><span>5</span></div><div style=\"background:#3d522a\" title=\"--lime-6: #3d522a\"><span>6</span></div><div style=\"background:#496231\" title=\"--lime-7: #496231\"><span>7</span></div><div style=\"background:#577538\" title=\"--lime-8: #577538\"><span>8</span></div><div style=\"background:#bdee63\" title=\"--lime-9: #bdee63\"><span>9</span></div><div style=\"background:#d4ff70\" title=\"--lime-10: #d4ff70\"><span>10</span></div><div style=\"background:#bde56c\" title=\"--lime-11: #bde56c\"><span>11</span></div><div style=\"background:#e3f7ba\" title=\"--lime-12: #e3f7ba\"><span>12</span></div></div>\n</div>",
